    "body": "Sandbox-only candidate. Goal: one durable restore/search/self-heal + verified learning + deterministic optimized policy layer over existing Permanent Archive V1. No merge, no production activation, no SHERIFF runtime mutation.\n\nCURRENT SANDBOX STATUS = PASS\nBASE = d805242a8ba6e2b169c1216acd3df86b8f9ddd84\nHEAD = 0f7042bdd8ce14a0e866d1ea544a59a5fbc01069\nFINAL CI RUN = 33269199879\nHQ_VALIDATE = PASS\nFULL UNIT TESTS = 290/290 PASS\nSCOPE_GUARD = PASS\nCONTROL_TOWER_INTEGRITY = PASS\nPR_STATE = OPEN / DRAFT / NOT_MERGED\nMAIN_UNCHANGED = d805242a8ba6e2b169c1216acd3df86b8f9ddd84\n\nProven sandbox behavior:\n- stale structured claims are corrected from fresher durable evidence;\n- unsupported claims fail closed as NOT_PROVEN;\n- restore results remain evidence-bound to RAW/source metadata;\n- only CLOSED SHERIFF verdicts with regressionTest + lessonRef become verified lessons;\n- OPEN/incomplete verdicts do not train policy;\n- verified lessons produce deterministic TRAINING_CORPUS.jsonl and CURRENT_LESSONS.json;\n- relevant lessons compile through SQLite FTS5 into a task-specific policy prefix;\n- deterministic optimizer deduplicates identical verified rules without losing regression coverage;\n- conflicting rules for the same error signature fail closed;\n- accepted optimized policy is persisted as CURRENT_OPTIMIZED_POLICY.json;\n- restart bootstrap consumes only accepted optimized policy and still gives fresher RAW/current GitHub evidence precedence;\n- no polling, new daemon, new model service, merge, or production activation was added.\n\nTDD evidence:\n- restore/self-heal RED 33268042938 -> GREEN 33268102845\n- durable learning RED 33268363857 -> GREEN 33268441290\n- automatic learning integration RED 33268484555 -> GREEN 33268629193\n- optimizer RED 33268934746 -> GREEN 33269044330\n- bootstrap-consumption RED 33269072333 -> GREEN 33269101844\n- exact final HEAD fresh verification 33269199879 -> 290/290 PASS; all three jobs PASS.\n\nBoundary: SANDBOX PASS only. GPT model weights are not modified. main/production remain unchanged.",
